{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VoXk7jUn6Eh7eHa3YkrNaA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:43.677396+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VoXk7jUn6Eh7eHa3YkrNaA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGDicjB4dwGWQo8JajwQkvORZ0rA4yH1CDyy25dn2HuY52B2zJb2n2JZIFsuvAPia7puDPPxceASzvgQdbPmYpqkSCml05dNvrpo0s/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>江苏 • 南京</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/zw9oejf3iawfqDqiadlKo9GBuaBxwMICozO6uAqDCJdnYcqTQBCR4Pu5rCEe8m6h0ZKDJZqAw3kepz6ZXZDGZPQmPTRq1pe4pAcAUvLPmatnw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/zw9oejf3iawcHHp86qQrYxp2opWoTkgjcHVVKYMeZbHvxln6zZ3BwxCn4uMWWmhSoxVgCHBfdZDHtVOYQ1BSKic20zxcCTtTgurib5xlS12ocY/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9UFagAZOGDibPzOFMKIibsqklribBwEXcdNtnptkBu1DxiciciaDEKQJ9xgwZ3Qao5ZoYenvscblOM7xfZHdVMB0NjMFMzGiaQjia33mo38DMsAverQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>东南大学公共卫生学院</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2027年接收推荐免试研究生报名通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>根据学校2027年推荐免试研究生工作部署，制订本学院具体工作方案并通知如下。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGD8nOG0svAtyYUicazGRDTiaUibmibz4XCUNk8Sj2AJcbFuUbczVOeeoEIgNFWN6vXflNQOr2Uqs1ujpnZuBeDsxXa7L17fU1oSPPHE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 一、学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9UFagAZOGDibY5ibvDoMvkYJLMV41g1JeRWzFVbcXTkLNGx9dzESJYrSUoMtcp8HRv6UdibeDTK8qZGE5ukIFQRzUWQXyZPIdzhwOBp4QEqFtQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>东南大学公共卫生学院办学历史可追溯至1935年，其前身为原中央大学医学院相关卫生学科，并在后续发展中逐步形成具有鲜明特色的公共卫生与预防医学人才培养体系。学院始终坚持医工结合与多学科交叉的发展道路，积极探索</span><span><strong><span>“面向公共卫生与预防医学重大问题，依托理工医交叉优势，发展新技术、新方法，培养医工结合型高层次复合人才”</span></strong></span><span>的战略方向，形成了较为鲜明的学科特色并取得了显著成效。</span></p><p><span><span>学院现建有公共卫生与预防医学、公共管理</span></span><strong><span><span>两个一级学科博士点及博士后科研流动站</span></span></strong><span><span>。其中，公共卫生与预防医学一级学科为“十四五”江苏省重点学科，是东南大学“双一流”和“特色医科攀升计划”重点建设学科，也是支撑东南大学药理学与毒理学、环境科学与生态学、农业科学</span></span><strong><span><span>进</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>入ESI全球前1%</span></span></strong><span><span>的重要贡献学科。公共管理一级学科所属医疗保障相关专业始建于1995年，是</span></span><strong><span><span>国内最早开展医疗保险本科层次人才培养的学科点之一</span></span></strong><span><span>，也是</span></span><strong><span><span>教育部首批招收“劳动与社会保障”专业试点的八所高校之一</span></span></strong><span><span>。2025年，学校成立东南大学卫生政策与医疗保障研究中心，进一步强化卫生政策、医疗保障与公共治理领域的学科布局和人才培养支撑。</span></span><strong><span>学院现有专任教师60人，国家级人才7人，省部级人才17人，95%以上教师具有海外留学或研修经历</span></strong><span>。</span><span><span>同时，学院依托医工交叉和行业协同优势，汇聚了一批具有多学科背景和丰富实践经验的校外导师，共同参与研究生培养工作。</span></span></p><p><span>学院建有以医工交叉为鲜明特色的</span><strong><span><span>环境医学工程教育部重点实验室</span></span></strong><span>，参与共建果蝇与线虫国家生物资源库、数字医学全国重点实验室、器官芯片研究院等</span><strong><span><span>国家级、省部级及校级科研平台</span></span></strong><span>。学院还与江苏省疾病预防控制中心、溧水区卫生健康委员会、南京中科药业有限公司等单位共建省级研究生工作站，并依托江苏省人民医院、南京市疾病预防控制中心等单位建设</span><strong><span><span>30余个研究生创新实践基地</span></span></strong><span>，为研究生开展科学研究、专业实践和交叉创新提供了坚实保障。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGD8nOG0svAtyYUicazGRDTiaUibmibz4XCUNk8Sj2AJcbFuUbczVOeeoEIgNFWN6vXflNQOr2Uqs1ujpnZuBeDsxXa7L17fU1oSPPHE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 二、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.在本科学校可取得推荐免试研究生资格；</span></p><p><span>2.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，无有违学术道德等行为；</span></p><p><span>4.身心健康；</span></p><p><span>5.英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>6.申请本科直博者，除满足以上条件外，应热爱科学研究，具有较强的科研创新能力和博士生培养潜质。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGD8nOG0svAtyYUicazGRDTiaUibmibz4XCUNk8Sj2AJcbFuUbczVOeeoEIgNFWN6vXflNQOr2Uqs1ujpnZuBeDsxXa7L17fU1oSPPHE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 三、申请者报名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>系统报名要求</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）登录</span><strong><span>东南大学研究生报考服务系统</span></strong><span>（https://gsas.seu.edu.cn/logon，以下简称“系统”），选择“接收推荐免试研究生”项目。</span></p><p><span>（2）</span><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong><span><strong><span><span>2026年7月15日中午12:00—8月15日中午12:00</span></span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>（3）</span><strong><span>申请者只能申请一个志愿</span></strong><span>，请务必慎重选择，如实填写各项信息，信息填写完毕后认真核对，提交后将无法再做更改。如未通过学院审核，可视其他学院报名时间申请第二个志愿。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>提交材料要求</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请者在系统中报名时，须线上提交以下材料，且</span><strong><span>须保证所提交材料的真实性和准确性</span></strong><span>，若弄虚作假，一经发现，取消申请资格。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9UFagAZOGDicc3KDH1qiaSyLoH7RaNicB448ywEviarCAsOiao7fz27AjTelcmibiaRhlpszibqV8ZeMEfaUPLr2cDAEcchGVmvAhebgQfLhVhJoBc0/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGD8nOG0svAtyYUicazGRDTiaUibmibz4XCUNk8Sj2AJcbFuUbczVOeeoEIgNFWN6vXflNQOr2Uqs1ujpnZuBeDsxXa7L17fU1oSPPHE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 四、审核与确认</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院审核</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>报名结束后，学院将从已提交报名信息的申请者中择优筛选,届时将通过学院官网（https://gw.seu.edu.cn）公布入选名单。</span><strong><span>请申请者及时关注学院官网发布的入选名单，以免错失机会。未入选者不再另行通知</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>入选者确认</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>公布入选名单两天内，学院将通过系统发布具体工作安排，入选者须及时在系统中回复“确认参加”或“确认不参加”，未在规定时间内回复者，将视为自动放弃。</span><strong><span>请入选者及时关注系统中的工作安排，以免错失机会</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGD8nOG0svAtyYUicazGRDTiaUibmibz4XCUNk8Sj2AJcbFuUbczVOeeoEIgNFWN6vXflNQOr2Uqs1ujpnZuBeDsxXa7L17fU1oSPPHE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 五、其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. </span><strong><span>拟申请本学院推免的校内外应届本科生，均需报名</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2. 线上活动：</span><strong><span>2026年7月13日17:00-18:00</span></strong><span>，东南大学研究生招生直播宣讲会，地址：https://yzconsole.360eol.com/web/pc/ny.html?id=11638。</span></p><p><span>3. 推免活动期间学院提供餐券，申请者住宿及差旅自理。</span></p><p><span>4. 如遇政策调整，以相关政策规定为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGD8nOG0svAtyYUicazGRDTiaUibmibz4XCUNk8Sj2AJcbFuUbczVOeeoEIgNFWN6vXflNQOr2Uqs1ujpnZuBeDsxXa7L17fU1oSPPHE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 六、咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><span><span>马老师</span></span></p><p><strong><span>咨询电话：</span></strong></p><p><span>025-83272398</span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>工作时间：上午9:00-11:30，下午14:00-17:00</span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>咨询邮箱：</span></strong></p><p><span>103009028@seu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>7月13日-8月19日为暑假期间，请尽量邮箱咨询</span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>编     辑｜马   喆</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>一审一校｜刘珂家</span></p><p><span>二审二校｜马   月</span></p><p><span>三审三校｜张   婷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGDicuLMyrCCMfd5iaDxY5ZlA2cQfGUhWIURbxjxyc4Q0icsav1VjAwx4WC4hzebo3E7arDLthJ8v3kSJnEk6s1mMfUNwYvAnoW6phA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9UFagAZOGDibcBf2Y1iahicqfokOa9kOZuibdbXVH77TyuxfSps2cQ7HYuTjIUfkgsIdShqw8AGncryBnibUv5QMXWfDFCmgibEf211WaNqPSux2U/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c5068d8853ad6042fa5111eed14945c385a5385e5b0c1129f2c64d2a1c303c03","textLength":1849,"sourceSha256":"24bdcd4905c9af860625f977a11d579d8da9dc97abb1827b11de8315c9a23fa7","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8d8be0e40df1e0a7a2f6","title":"2026年东南大学公共卫生学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:43.677396+00:00"}
